  "project_description": "Administer your Leaflet layers through the Drupal UI and combine layers from multiple modules into bundles (groups of maps that can be used on your website).\n\n Why? \n\n By default you can choose between the maps provided by different modules. But you cannot combine maps from different providers without creating a module yourself.\n\n With this module you get a interface for combining layers from different modules into a bundle\n\nyou can use in your map.\n\n It is also possible to add a layer directly through this module.",
